{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488459-sc-2e-how-to-rise-legend","id":1488459,"title":"[Sc 2E] How to rise Legend?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-30T07:31:24-07:00","id":1488459,"title":"[Sc 2E] How to rise Legend?","content":"I know that character get new point of Legend when they each fullfill their Short, Long and Band Deed. Band Deed is mostly chronicle/series arc played out. But I still have question WHEN rising of Legend happens.<br /> <br /> My players have as Band Deed <i>'Defeat Evil Organisation'</i>. <b>Now, <i>when</i> this Band Deed is resolved? </b>Characters killed one of higher officers of organisation, they now hunt for the CEO of it - and then, on the billionaire patron of it. They literally blown up office of Evil Org.<br /> <br /> So my questions are those:<br /> <br /> 1. <b>Players Characters resolve Band Deed when...</b><br /> A. <b>They blown up office of Evil Org</b> - cause public face of it is 'dead'.<br /> B. <b>When they kill CEO of it</b> - as the leader of Org, he is responsible and 'symbol' of Org.<br /> C. <b>When they kill billionaire patron</b> - as he is de facto inspiration for Org, it's grand master to Org being only his chess piece.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>HOW raise of Legend max points looks like for PCs?</b> They are strike by divine lighting and l<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dbvHem94cPA\" target=\"_blank\">ike He-Man, say 'I have a Power!'</a> in one second? Or they got next small Visitation like vision in their sleep? Something other happens? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-30-2022, 12:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-30T08:27:10-07:00","id":1488460,"title":"","content":"Considering that Legend is about, well the legend of the characters, I would say it raises when the word of their deed spreads. As the news proclaim the organisation has fallen or the word otherwise spreads. So it is a slow raise of Power as the characters reputation spreads.<br /> <br /> As to what constitues the fall of the organisation that depends on the SG. Stricly speaking taking out the HQ and the CEO should perhaps be enough and taking out the Sponsor could be the next deed.<br /> <br /> But this is just my view of matters and ymmv.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-31T19:29:17-07:00","id":1488641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Possessed</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488459-sc-2e-how-to-rise-legend?p=1488460#post1488460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Considering that Legend is about, well the legend of the characters, I would say it raises when the word of their deed spreads. As the news proclaim the organisation has fallen or the word otherwise spreads. So it is a slow raise of Power as the characters reputation spreads.</div> </div> </div> </div>I kind of see this in reverse. IIRC the books say that a Scion's fame increases in reflection of her rising legend, rather than the other way around. So the completion of the deed itself causes the rise of legend, but it would be fitting for a storyguide to narrate it as the records of history or social media spreading the word. Perhaps there's some dramatic license taken by the narrations--did the Scion really walk out of the explosion unscathed? Did they *really* plant the CEO in the pavement like a sapling and carve their epitaph in the erupted pavement like a headstone? A PC's Legend score, like so much of the character sheet, is a mechanical and concrete abstraction that doesn't cleanly reflect the gradual growth of a character's myth.<br /> <br /> It was probably big and memorable at the time. It'll almost certainly change in the retelling. It'll get bigger. Louder. In years to come people will get details wrong as they see themselves reflected in the PC's deeds. Does it matter? Not really.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Possessed</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488459-sc-2e-how-to-rise-legend?p=1488460#post1488460\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As to what constitues the fall of the organisation that depends on the SG. Stricly speaking taking out the HQ and the CEO should perhaps be enough and taking out the Sponsor could be the next deed.</div> </div> </div> </div>For what it is worth, I absolutely agree with this. The Billionaire Backer is definitely worth milking a little longer and being the target of a later deed, if not a recurring figure. I'd say the point where you say EvilCo is no longer able to recover is the point where the deed is completed. I'm not saying it has to wait until the literal moment of its ending; it's kind of silly to have a Scion in line for a hot dog or whatever when suddenly their Legend goes up because somewhere the board of directors agreed to formally dissolve the company. But something big and narratively significant where you, as storyguide, feel comfortable calling their victory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T01:08:27-07:00","id":1488675,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mockery</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488459-sc-2e-how-to-rise-legend?p=1488641#post1488641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For what it is worth, I absolutely agree with this. The Billionaire Backer is definitely worth milking a little longer and being the target of a later deed, if not a recurring figure. I'd say the point where you say EvilCo is no longer able to recover is the point where the deed is completed. I'm not saying it has to wait until the literal moment of its ending; it's kind of silly to have a Scion in line for a hot dog or whatever when suddenly their Legend goes up because somewhere the board of directors agreed to formally dissolve the company. But something big and narratively significant where you, as storyguide, feel comfortable calling their victory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Let's go with this interpretation. <b>CEO of EvilCo is just killed</b><b>, PCs are hanging over him with smoking guns, just 1 turn ( few seconds ) later.</b> They in this moment have 'I have a power!' moment, rising their Legend by 1 point? They need to retreat to home and connect with their Divine Patron, like in prayer or sleep? Or they get Legend +1 when first tabloid write about death of CEO and their involvement?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T05:51:03-07:00","id":1488686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488459-sc-2e-how-to-rise-legend?p=1488675#post1488675\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Let's go with this interpretation. <b>CEO of EvilCo is just killed</b><b>, PCs are hanging over him with smoking guns, just 1 turn ( few seconds ) later.</b> They in this moment have 'I have a power!' moment, rising their Legend by 1 point? They need to retreat to home and connect with their Divine Patron, like in prayer or sleep? Or they get Legend +1 when first tabloid write about death of CEO and their involvement?</div> </div> </div> </div>While I would generally not feel the need to be so precise about it, I'd say that it would be in that next turn. At that point, the Deed is Done, and everything else (e.g. their patron racing out to recognize or congratulate them, the spread of their public recognition, etc) is in reaction to that.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't feel the need for a he-man or highlander-esque visible display of increasing power, but that's just me and my own dramatic tastes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T08:53:22-07:00","id":1488703,"title":"","content":"I like that interpretation too. The instant Loki crawls out of his Hulk-inflicted hole and sez; &quot;if it's all the same to you, I'll have that drink now...&quot; is when all the Avengers would have jumped in Legend had they ALL been scions. All the chat about their deeds that follows in montage is just narrative.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/765-darksol-aeternium","name":"Darksol-aeternium","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar765_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"392"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T09:25:12-07:00","id":1488712,"title":"","content":"Legend is about stories being told, the character will not notice their power increasing, it will happen between sessions. People must start talking about the death of the EvilCo CEO before the character legend grows.<br /> <br /> Legend is not something palpable, the characters don\u2019t know they have legend, or even legend dots, they have powers and they know they can use the powers because it is part of them. The character will not try to use a marvel and fail because he is out of energy, he will probably have a silly explanation to why he didn\u2019t use that power before.<br /> <br /> The same way the character don\u2019t know he is fatebinding someone, he just can use the power now and after sometime something happen to his friend, or the gaudy that saw the fight or something like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T10:39:39-07:00","id":1488724,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1488459-sc-2e-how-to-rise-legend?p=1488712#post1488712\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Legend is about stories being told, the character will not notice their power increasing, it will happen between sessions. People must start talking about the death of the EvilCo CEO before the character legend grows.</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like as written this isn't the case:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scion: Hero, p. 187</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Legend trait is the measure of the Scion\u2019s mythic weight, reflecting the favor of her divine parent and the glory of her epic deeds. As a Scion\u2019s Legend grows, she gains access to greater Boons and Knacks. She also becomes better-known in her pantheon and the World. This isn\u2019t a function of fleeting mortal fame, however, as simply having millions of social media followers won\u2019t increase a Scion\u2019s might. Legend represents a shaping of humanity\u2019s unconscious to accommodate the Scion and their Deeds. <br /> <br /> Having a high Legend nets you a lot of social media followers, not the other way around.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T10:47:16-07:00","id":1488726,"title":"","content":"\u201cLegend represents a shaping of humanity\u2019s unconscious to accommodate the Scion and their Deeds.\u201d<br /> <br /> It is what I said all along. If no one knows, there is no impact in the humanity unconscious and so no legend is created.<br /> <br /> The character don\u2019t kill the CEO and \u201clevels up in a ball of divine fire\u201d, they gain power as what they did impacts the world and reach the humanity\u2019s unconscious.<br /> <br /> In other words, the character don\u2019t gain a title if they didn\u2019t do anything relevant enough to impact humanity\u2019s unconscious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 08-01-2022, 01:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T19:55:52-07:00","id":1488754,"title":"","content":"I feel like this is a bit of a chicken and the egg sort of thing.<br /> <br /> In my mind, the chain of events goes like this: <br /> <br /> Scion and/or Band do Deeds. Deed makes legend go up. Legend makes the world talk about you and your Deeds. When the deed is accomplished is when you make the impact of yourself in the undercurrent of myth in the world, and this is when your legend rises<br /> <br /> If you did it in secret, then it is still *known*, as far as I care. People don't have evidence, there's not a court around that could convict you. But the people who know about you, and know about EvilCo and that it's done for, just have an instinctive feeling that you were involved. A couple people you helped out two arcs ago hear that EvilCo fell on TV, and they look to each other. &quot;How much you want to bet Bob Scion had something to do with that?&quot; One asks the other, and they both laugh and nod, because that's so obviously *you* even when they didn't even know you had a grudge against EvilCo in the first place. <br /> <br /> If I haven't made it clear, I don't feel like ascending in legend is flashy in general. If you're ascending to a new state of being, perhaps--from Hero to Demigod, probably, and almost certainly from Demigod to full-fledged divinity. But in general, a Scion feels a sort of frisson, and a sensation that this thing they've been trying to do is now *done.*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/561-mockery","name":"Mockery","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar561_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"876"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T20:13:03-07:00","id":1488755,"title":"","content":"I dont think the point is the character be known, or the character be famous. The character could be an urban legend, or someone people talk about and have no idea who they are.<br /> <br /> Lets say, you killed EvilCo CEO, people know he was killed and thats basically it, some will see the band as heroes, others as villains, but they dont need to know who killed, they are just &quot;the ones that the EvilCo CEO&quot;, their title will be related to it somehow.<br /> <br /> A deed dont need to be awesome, it just need to be important enough so people will talk about it. If it is irrelevant it is not a deed.<br /> <br /> But yes, it can be the other way around, people talk because you make them talk by becoming a legend, and not people talk ant it turns you into a legend (my approach).<br /> <br /> Sorry if I said it was you who said it would be like he-man, not the intention.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 08-01-2022, 11:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T10:55:21-07:00","id":1488992,"title":"","content":"I think there's a lot of really interesting subtleties to be considered about what the collective unconscious must be in the game and the relationship Fate has with it. To be consistent with our out of game appreciation of mythology there's quite clearly got to be a lot of stuff that makes it to the collective unconscious that never turns into the specific deeds of the hero being recounted until well after the hero has obviously leveled up if at all...myth is full of people showing up out of nowhere faster, stronger, smarter than ever before to take revenge. In the game obviously they would need to have been getting more legend by deeds...but equally obviously the story of their deeds, which must have been spectacular, would have not have spread as far as needed to actually warn the target.<br /> <br /> I mean c'mon ... Lugh shows up for the Tuatha seemingly out of nowhere. One moment he's being passed around in fosterage...then next we hear his face shines like the sun and Balor is in real trouble. While one can reasonably say maybe some of his deeds were known but no-one had connected them to the prophecy, or have since been forgotten, the impression of the situation the stories give us isn't of a steadily building public awareness of Lugh becoming stronger and stronger. <br /> <br /> I like the idea of sometimes Fate having to catch up to the hero. The hero can, if clever enough, sneak off and do a great deed in private, harvest the benefits and seemingly stay a private person. Maybe Fate will let that deed stay private. But ripples spread through the collective unconscious. Why did those serial killings stop? What happened to that guy who used to drive a truck round the small town, who was he anyway? Fate isn't going to let the hero just get away with having any impact without consequences. Legend goes up. Fatebinding becomes more likely. If there are no people round to bind to then fate might bind you to places, things, ideas, story elements from your parents past. If you killed someone without legal basis maybe justice gods just keep crossing your path. You keep doing things to keep your secret and those things become public. Fate catches up.<br /> <br /> So obviously Legend increase outside of major milestones can be a subtle event to our conscious appreciation of the hero. Fate never fails to notice. Fate always catches up with the hero","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27530,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27530-woottoot","user":"Woottoot","date":". 08-03-2022, 02:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27530-woottoot","name":"Woottoot","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}